الأولى 1448\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"num mt-2.5 text-[12.5px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                            7 nights · 10 rooms · 3 lines\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-1\">\n                            Lifecycle\n                        </p>\n                        <ol class=\"mt-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2\">\n                            <li class=\"relative grid grid-cols-[18px_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-2.5 pb-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute left-[8px] top-3 h-full w-px bg-[var(--desk-line)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"relative z-10 mt-0.5 flex size-[17px] items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-ink)] text-[10px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1-2\">\n                                    <i class=\"i icon-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1-2-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1-3\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1-3-1\">\n                                        Request\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"num text-[11px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-1-3-2\">\n                                        14 Oct\n                                    </span>\n                   