</span>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-3-2\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-3-2-1\">\n                                        Confirmed\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-3-2-3-2-2\">\n                                        next\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </li>\n                        </ol>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4\">\n                        <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-warning-line)] bg-[var(--desk-warning-soft)] p-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1-1-1\">\n                                    Hold expires\n                                </p>\n                                <span class=\"num shrink-0 rounded border border-[var(--desk-warning-line)] bg-white px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1-1-2\">\n                                    1 day 6 h\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"num mt-1 text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1-2\">\n                                Fri 16 Oct · 02:52\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-4-1-3\"