-desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-1-3\">\n                                        Since the reservation was created, 14 Oct.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-2\">\n                                    <p class=\"border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-2-1\">\n                                        Room release impact\n                                    </p>\n                                    <div class=\"p-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-2-2\">\n                                        <p class=\"num text-[12.5px] leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-text)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1\">\n                                            Cancelling frees\n                                            <span class=\"font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                                10 rooms\n                                            </span>\n                                            back to Manarat ghaza hotel · 6 contract, 4 direct.\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"num mt-2 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-2-2-2\">\n                                            SAR 7,510 stays unpaid. Nothing is refunded automatically.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"waiting on a reply card\">\n                                    <p class=\"border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"waiting on a reply card title\">\n                                        Waiting on a reply\n                                    </p>\n                                    <ul class=\"divide-y divide-[var(--desk-line-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"pending decisions list\">\n                                        <li class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"supplier request pending item\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"supplier request item name\">\n                                                Supplier request\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"num mt-0.5 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"supplier request item detail\">\n                                                Manarat ghaza hotel · Triple, 3 rooms · sent 15 Oct, 08:12\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"num mt-1 text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"supplier request deadline text\">\n                                                48 h deadline in 15 h\n                                            </p>\n                                        </li>\n                                        <li class=\"px-3.5 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"cancellation decision pending item\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"cancellation decision item name\">\n                                                Cancellation decision\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"num mt-0.5 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"cancellation decision item detail\">\n                                                Requested by the agency · 15 Oct, 07:58\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"num mt-1 text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-warning-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"cancellation decision hold expiry text\">\n                                                Hold lapses Fri 16 Oct, 02:52\n                                            </p>\n                                        </li>\n                                    </ul>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"flex h-9 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"export activity CSV button\">\n                                    <i class=\"i icon-download text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"download icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Export activity (CSV)\n                                </button>\n                                <p class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-[16px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2-2-3-2-5\" data-name=\"footer note about editability\">\n                                    Falco team and System entries cannot be edited. Agency entries show who acted.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-15T09:38:02.334935+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-15T09:45:09.899441+00:00",
      "id": "var_f515a7163df1",
      "contentHeight": 1224
    },
    "var_e075b70bf3e7": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "6 · New reservation",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 7700,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n  @import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css\");\n  @layer base {\n    :root {\n      --desk-canvas: #f8fafc;\n      --desk-surface: #ffffff;\n      --desk-surface-muted: #f1f5f9;\n      --desk-ink: #15375e;\n      --desk-text: #414649;\n      --desk-text-soft: #64748b;\n      --desk-muted-soft: #94a3b8;\n      --desk-primary: #2d60e0;\n      --desk-primary-hover: #1d4ed8;\n      --desk-primary-soft: #eff6ff;\n      --desk-line: #e2e8f0;\n      --desk-line-soft: #f1f5f9;\n      --desk-line-strong: #cbd5e1;\n      --desk-gold: #c59b27;\n      --desk-danger-ink: #b91c1c;\n      /* muted tier darkened so 12px helper text clears AA on white */\n      --desk-muted-soft: #6b788f;\n    }\n    body { background: var(--desk-canvas); color: var(--desk-ink); font-family: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\", sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }\n    .tnum { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n    .mono { font-family: \"IBM Plex Mono\", monospace; }\n    i[class*=\"icon-\"] { line-height: 1; font-style: normal; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[var(--desk-canvas)]\" data-kid=\"1\">\n    <!-- ================= APP CHROME : LEFT ICON RAIL ================= -->\n    <aside class=\"fixed inset-y-0 left-0 z-30 flex w-16 flex-col items-center border-e border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1\">\n        <div class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#0f2942] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">\n            <i class=\"icon-feather text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\">\n            </i>\n        </div>\n        <nav aria-label=\"Admin\" class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" title=\"Overview\">\n                <i class=\"icon-layout-dashboard\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button aria-current=\"page\" class=\"relative flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[var(--desk-primary-soft)] text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" title=\"Reservations\">\n                <i class=\"icon-bed-double\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"absolute end-1.5 top-1.5 size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-gold)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3\" title=\"Reports\">\n                <i class=\"icon-trending-up\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-3-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4\" title=\"Hotels\">\n                <i class=\"icon-building\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-4-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5\" title=\"Room types\">\n                <i class=\"icon-layers\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-5-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6\" title=\"Purchases\">\n                <i class=\"icon-clipboard-list\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-7\" title=\"Agencies\">\n                <i class=\"icon-users\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-7-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-8\" title=\"Rep performance\">\n                <i class=\"icon-circle-check\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-8-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-9\" title=\"Client groups\">\n                <i class=\"icon-folder-open\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-9-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-10\" title=\"Settings\">\n                <i class=\"icon-settings\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-10-1\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#0f2942] text-[12px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\">\n            N\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n    <!-- ================= APP CHROME : TOP BAR ================= -->\n    <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-20 ml-16 flex h-14 items-center gap-4 border-b border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-6\" data-kid=\"1-2\">\n        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-baseline gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\">\n            <h1 class=\"truncate text-[14px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\">\n                New reservation\n            </h1>\n            <span class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\">\n                /\n            </span>\n            <a class=\"shrink-0 text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:text-[var(--desk-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" href=\"#\">\n                Reservations\n            </a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ms-auto flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\">\n            <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\">\n                <i class=\"icon-search absolute start-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[15px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\">\n                </i>\n                <input class=\"h-9 w-72 rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white ps-9 pe-3 text-[13px] text-[var(--desk-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)] focus:border-[var(--desk-primary)] focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--desk-primary)]/20\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" placeholder=\"Search hotels and reservations\" type=\"search\"/>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\">\n                <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-[#a97d10]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\">\n                    SAR / USD\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"tnum text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\">\n                    3.7500\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <button aria-label=\"Notifications\" class=\"relative flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[16px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\">\n                <i class=\"icon-bell\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"absolute end-2 top-2 size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-gold)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\">\n                </span>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-ink)] text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-4\">\n                MD\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <!-- ================= PAGE BODY ================= -->\n    <main class=\"ml-16 px-6 py-6\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[980px] grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_300px] items-start gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n            <!-- ---------- LEFT : THE FORM ---------- -->\n            <form class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"form header section with title and status\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"form title and help text wrapper\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-[19px] font-semibold leading-6 tracking-tight text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                            New reservation\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-2\">\n                            Create the booking first — rooms and the supplier request follow.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 pt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"reservation status badge row\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] px-2.5 py-[3px] text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"reservation draft status badge\">\n                            <i class=\"icon-circle-dashed text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"dashed circle status icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Not created yet\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- GROUP 1 -->\n                <section class=\"border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                            Who is staying\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[var(--desk-line-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1-2\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2\">\n                        <label class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                    Agency\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                                    Required\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"relative block\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                <select class=\"h-9 w-full appearance-none rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-ink)] focus:border-[var(--desk-primary)] focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--desk-primary)]/20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                        Mohamed Dellai\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                        Atlas Voyages\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-2-1-3\">\n                                        Manasik Travel\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down pointer-events-none absolute end-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[15px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-1-3\">\n                                Only agencies with an open sale window are listed.\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <label class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2\">\n                            <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    Rep\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                                    Optional\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"relative block\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                <select class=\"h-9 w-full appearance-none rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-ink)] focus:border-[var(--desk-primary)] focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--desk-primary)]/20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                        No rep\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                                        Youssef Ben Ali\n                                    </option>\n                                    <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-2-1-3\">\n                                        Karim Haddad\n                                    </option>\n                                </select>\n                                <i class=\"icon-chevron-down pointer-events-none absolute end-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[15px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2-2-3\">\n                                Attribution only — it does not change pricing.\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                    </div>\n                    <label class=\"mt-3.5 grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                Guest name\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"tnum text-[11.5px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                5 / 160\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <input class=\"h-9 w-full rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-ink)] placeholder:font-normal placeholder:text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)] focus:border-[var(--desk-primary)] focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--desk-primary)]/20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3-2\" maxlength=\"160\" placeholder=\"Name as it appears on the passport\" type=\"text\" value=\"ahmed\"/>\n                        <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3-3\">\n                            Printed on the voucher and the rooming list.\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                </section>\n                <!-- GROUP 2 -->\n                <section class=\"border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-1-1\">\n                            Where and when\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[var(--desk-line-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-1-2\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <label class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                                Hotel\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-1-2\">\n                                Required\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"relative block\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-2\">\n                            <select class=\"h-9 w-full appearance-none rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3 text-[13.5px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-ink)] focus:border-[var(--desk-primary)] focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--desk-primary)]/20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-2-1\">\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    Manarat ghaza hotel — Makkah\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-2-1-2\">\n                                    Al Eiman Madinah Tower — Madinah\n                                </option>\n                                <option data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-2-1-3\">\n                                    Sofa Corniche — Jeddah\n                                </option>\n                            </select>\n                            <i class=\"icon-chevron-down pointer-events-none absolute end-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-[15px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2-2-2\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-1-1\">\n                                Reservation source\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-1-2\">\n                                Locked once a room is added\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div aria-label=\"Reservation source\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] p-[3px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-2\" role=\"radiogroup\">\n                            <button aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-[6px] bg-white px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)] shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(8,28,54,0.10)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-2-1\" role=\"radio\" type=\"button\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-check text-[14px] text-[var(--desk-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-2-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                From contract\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-checked=\"false\" class=\"flex h-8 items-center rounded-[6px] px-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-2-2\" role=\"radio\" type=\"button\">\n                                Hotel direct\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 flex items-start gap-1.5 text-[12.5px] leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-3\">\n                            <i class=\"icon-circle-info mt-[3px] shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-3-1\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3-3-2\">\n                                Rooms come from your contracted allotment and availability is checked automatically.\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-start gap-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4\">\n                        <label class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1\">\n                            <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-1-1\">\n                                    Check-in\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-1-2\">\n                                    Required\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex h-[50px] w-full items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3 transition hover:border-[var(--desk-line-strong)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-2\">\n                                <span class=\"grid\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-2-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"tnum text-[13.5px] font-semibold leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-2-1-1\">\n                                        Sat 31 Oct 2026\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-[14px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-2-1-2\" dir=\"rtl\">\n                                        20 جمادى الأولى 1448\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-calendar text-[15px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-1-2-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <label class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2\">\n                            <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-1-1\">\n                                    Check-out\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-danger-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-1-2\">\n                                    Needs fixing\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex h-[50px] w-full items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-lg border-2 border-[var(--desk-danger-ink)] bg-white px-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-2\">\n                                <span class=\"grid\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-2-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"tnum text-[13.5px] font-semibold leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-2-1-1\">\n                                        Sun 25 Oct 2026\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-[14px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-2-1-2\" dir=\"rtl\">\n                                        14 جمادى الأولى 1448\n                                    </span>\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"icon-calendar text-[15px] text-[var(--desk-danger-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-2-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-medium leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-danger-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-3\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-circle-alert mt-[2px] shrink-0 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-3-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-2-3-2\">\n                                    Check-out must be after check-in.\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-end gap-1.5 pt-[26px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-3\">\n                            <span class=\"flex h-[50px] items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] px-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-3-1\">\n                                <i class=\"icon-moon text-[14px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-3-1-1\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-3-1-2\">\n                                    — nights\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[11.5px] leading-[14px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-4-3-2\">\n                                Calculated from the stay\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <!-- GROUP 3 -->\n                <section class=\"px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.06em] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-1-1\">\n                            Notes\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-1-2\">\n                            Optional\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[var(--desk-line-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-1-3\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <label class=\"grid min-w-0 gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2-1\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-text)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2-1-1\">\n                                Internal note for this booking\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"tnum text-[11.5px] font-medium text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2-1-2\">\n                                0 / 2,000\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <textarea class=\"w-full resize-y rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3 py-2 text-[13.5px] leading-[20px] text-[var(--desk-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)] focus:border-[var(--desk-primary)] focus:outline-hidden focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--desk-primary)]/20\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2-2\" maxlength=\"2000\" placeholder=\"e.g. Guest needs a room near the Haram lift\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n                        <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2-3\">\n                            Never printed on a client or hotel document.\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-[var(--desk-canvas)] px-5 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5-1\">\n                        You can add rooms on the next screen.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5-2\">\n                        <button class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white px-3.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-text-soft)] transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-surface-muted)] hover:text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5-2-1\" type=\"button\">\n                            Discard\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-primary)] px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-[var(--desk-primary-hover)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5-2-2\" type=\"submit\">\n                            Create reservation\n                            <i class=\"icon-arrow-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-5-2-2-1\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n            <!-- ---------- RIGHT : WHAT HAPPENS NEXT ---------- -->\n            <aside class=\"sticky top-[76px] overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--desk-line)] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n                <div class=\"border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-4 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                        What happens next\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                        Three steps, in this order.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <ol data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-3 border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-4 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\">\n                        <span class=\"tnum mt-[1px] flex size-[22px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-primary-soft)] text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                            1\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"grid gap-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                Add room lines\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                Pick contract allotment or price hotel-direct rooms.\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-3 border-b border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] px-4 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                        <span class=\"tnum mt-[1px] flex size-[22px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-primary-soft)] text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                            2\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"grid gap-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                                Send the request to the hotel\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                                Tick the rooms, then send a request or amendment.\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex gap-3 px-4 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3\">\n                        <span class=\"tnum mt-[1px] flex size-[22px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[var(--desk-primary-soft)] text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-[var(--desk-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-1\">\n                            3\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"grid gap-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-2\">\n                            <span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold leading-[18px] text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-2-1\">\n                                Hold or confirm\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-3-2-2\">\n                                Accept the booking terms first; the hold needs a deadline.\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                    </li>\n                </ol>\n                <div class=\"border-t border-[var(--desk-line)] px-4 py-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3\">\n                    <p class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-text-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-1\">\n                        <i class=\"icon-square-check mt-[2px] shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                            Terms must be accepted before holding or confirming.\n                        </span>\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 border-t border-[var(--desk-line-soft)] pt-3 text-[12px] leading-[17px] text-[var(--desk-muted-soft)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2\">\n                        <span class=\"mono font-medium text-[var(--desk-ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-1\">\n                            A00016\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-3-2-2\">\n                            will be the next reservation number\n                        </span>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
